      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "3-Hydroxy-4-methoxy-acetophenone (HMA) isolated from Cynanchum paniculatum was found to have analgesic effect and inhibitory action on the gastro-intestinal motility. The effect and action were equivalent to that of paeonol, HMA displayed a very low degree of antibacterial activity against Escherichia coli and Shigella flexneri."},
